    "Recorded on the Python and platform named in oracle.environment; the CI platform (Linux, Node 22.x and 24.x for the checks) was not exercised for the oracle.",
    "Releases under pins.not_covered exist but were not exercised; no claim is made for them or for any version other than the pins.",
    "Nothing here ran against a database server or an application: the oracle imports model modules and reads MetaData, it does not call create_all or open an engine, so status.runtime_tested stays false.",
    "The migration scanner reads Flyway and Liquibase layouts only (see probes.migration_plane); Alembic was not installed.",
    "The bridge is exercised through a temporary repository (pyproject.toml declaring fastapi and sqlmodel, a FastAPI main.py stub, the fixture model file); other project layouts may be detected differently.",
